      "source_text": "她今后，一定会成长得更加出色……\n朝着无比璀璨的未来，\n一步步走下去――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ba5922d373994754309e9b031136ac1da7fa909e1e7f5b23f312481dbde65b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2f39c0bb500f3c54407df0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随后，在『伊丽莎白女王杯』结束数日后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b41effa743e6d5ef25fe3348e9f9896ad0d47567c8e239c9fd4ef79133c074",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d72002e1d2637674379f410",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们决定在训练员室，\n举办一场小小的庆功会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f406517e929f734f84f97ca14249cba70744282b23b4e9c740370c9cc0a46099",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5596770be7f6fe88e871af8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56ee7c7f5a53abb34204caaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我，成功证明了吗）",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66b21ce61d08a3ac94aa4784cf1949d038c2877c60673a6970d4ac4e0913d65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45371f2874d74217311df57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，事前也做了周密商议。\n我们以『庆祝胜利，为继续前进养精蓄锐』为主题\n决定了活动内容――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae4d0f4818406fbd9a8719ec6f96e34f90ba16fdb6dcc864bb5b45f57d27bcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f9fbdeda519913d71c732d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后又给空中救世主的朋友们和前辈后辈，\n寄出写明时间与地点的，邀请函。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b571fa6516c3a79574489cfe89e9c711bd8376d73bcada16ca7489736e757c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e91b364f192716303d332fbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就按计划，我们先开始吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "83fdff4f8870271925768d94fd548fecc0a8689238fb8181470153e5121d198d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
