      "uid": "zhcn:58b07b47edcb7f0ba20aaa62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……果然最重要的是\n『不可朝向人类或赛马娘鸣放』\n这一条。",
      "source_fingerprint": "894c6dce6c4152bb2a673dbdd7a30b74e478602b17c178d0488e7b0158e9d3b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
